{"route":"/docs/6.0/forms/radio/","version":"6.0","renderedVersion":"6.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Radio","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Highly customizable, native radio <code>&lt;input&gt;</code> elements for choosing one option from many."},"blocks":[{"id":"basic-radio","type":"heading","en":"Basic radio","level":2},{"id":"basic-radio--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Similar to checkboxes, radios are styled with the <code>.radio</code> class. However, there’s no custom SVG as we use pure CSS to style the input and its checked state."},{"id":"basic-radio--example-1","type":"demo","key":"b20e3dd775f88a1bd86b","height":147,"anchors":["radio"]},{"id":"basic-radio--code-1","type":"code","value":"<input type=\"radio\" id=\"radio\" class=\"radio\" />","language":""},{"id":"with-form-field","type":"heading","en":"With form field","level":2},{"id":"with-form-field--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Wrap the <code>.radio</code> in a <code>.form-field</code> layout wrapper and add your label. The grid layout places the radio and label side by side."},{"id":"with-form-field--example-1","type":"demo","key":"fde97e403f7c7975adeb","height":174,"anchors":["radioLabel","radioLabel2"]},{"id":"with-form-field--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <input class=\"radio\" name=\"radios\" type=\"radio\" id=\"radioLabel\" />\n  <label for=\"radioLabel\">First example radio</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <input class=\"radio\" name=\"radios\" type=\"radio\" id=\"radioLabel2\" />\n  <label for=\"radioLabel2\">Second example radio</label>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"description","type":"heading","en":"Description","level":2},{"id":"description--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add a description or other content after the label. We recommend wrapping the label and description in a <code>.form-field-content</code> to ensure appropriate spacing and alignment."},{"id":"description--example-1","type":"demo","key":"c4820804a435cfdb33bd","height":147,"anchors":["radioLabelDescription"]},{"id":"description--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <input type=\"radio\" id=\"radioLabelDescription\" class=\"radio\" />\n  <div class=\"form-field-content\">\n    <label for=\"radioLabelDescription\" class=\"fw-medium\">Example new radio</label>\n    <small class=\"form-text\">Supporting description for the above label.</small>\n  </div>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"theme-colors","type":"heading","en":"Theme colors","level":2},{"id":"theme-colors--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Modify the appearance of checked radios by adding the <code>.theme-{color}</code> class to the <code>.radio</code> element. This will set the checked background and border color to the theme color."},{"id":"theme-colors--example-1","type":"demo","key":"e7fb7aaeaa2ef1e98ae6","height":300,"anchors":["radioprimary","radioaccent","radiosuccess","radiodanger","radiowarning","radioinfo","radioinverse","radiosecondary"]},{"id":"theme-colors--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <input type=\"radio\" id=\"radioprimary\" class=\"radio theme-primary\" checked />\n  <label for=\"radioprimary\">Example primary radio</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <input type=\"radio\" id=\"radioaccent\" class=\"radio theme-accent\" checked />\n  <label for=\"radioaccent\">Example accent radio</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <input type=\"radio\" id=\"radiosuccess\" class=\"radio theme-success\" checked />\n  <label for=\"radiosuccess\">Example success radio</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <input type=\"radio\" id=\"radiodanger\" class=\"radio theme-danger\" checked />\n  <label for=\"radiodanger\">Example danger radio</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <input type=\"radio\" id=\"radiowarning\" class=\"radio theme-warning\" checked />\n  <label for=\"radiowarning\">Example warning radio</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <input type=\"radio\" id=\"radioinfo\" class=\"radio theme-info\" checked />\n  <label for=\"radioinfo\">Example info radio</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <input type=\"radio\" id=\"radioinverse\" class=\"radio theme-inverse\" checked />\n  <label for=\"radioinverse\">Example inverse radio</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <input type=\"radio\" id=\"radiosecondary\" class=\"radio theme-secondary\" checked />\n  <label for=\"radiosecondary\">Example secondary radio</label>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"disabled","type":"heading","en":"Disabled","level":2},{"id":"disabled--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add the <code>disabled</code> attribute and the associated <code>&lt;label&gt;</code>s are automatically styled to match with a lighter color to help indicate the input’s state."},{"id":"disabled--example-1","type":"demo","key":"81da6d7555a8752a15e9","height":174,"anchors":["radioDisabled","radioCheckedDisabled"]},{"id":"disabled--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <input type=\"radio\" id=\"radioDisabled\" class=\"radio\" disabled />\n  <label for=\"radioDisabled\">Example new radio</label>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <input type=\"radio\" id=\"radioCheckedDisabled\" class=\"radio\" disabled checked />\n  <label for=\"radioCheckedDisabled\">Example checked disabled radio</label>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"sizes","type":"heading","en":"Sizes","level":2},{"id":"sizes--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add <code>.radio-sm</code> or <code>.radio-lg</code> to make your radio appear smaller or larger."},{"id":"sizes--example-1","type":"demo","key":"9e711baea3e4abba6fae","height":201,"anchors":["radioSizeSm","radioSizeMd","radioSizeLg"]},{"id":"sizes--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <input type=\"radio\" id=\"radioSizeSm\" class=\"radio radio-sm\" checked />\n  <label for=\"radioSizeSm\">Small radio</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <input type=\"radio\" id=\"radioSizeMd\" class=\"radio\" checked />\n  <label for=\"radioSizeMd\">Default radio</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <input type=\"radio\" id=\"radioSizeLg\" class=\"radio radio-lg\" checked />\n  <label for=\"radioSizeLg\">Large radio</label>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"variables","type":"heading","en":"Variables","level":3},{"id":"variables--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"CSS variables for the radio component are built on the Sass variables."},{"id":"variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"// stylelint-disable-next-line scss/dollar-variable-default\n$radio-tokens: defaults(\n  (\n    --radio-size: 1.25rem,\n    --radio-margin-block: .125rem,\n    --radio-bg: var(--bg-body),\n    --radio-border-color: var(--border-color),\n    --radio-checked-bg: var(--control-checked-bg),\n    --radio-checked-border-color: var(--control-checked-border-color),\n    --radio-disabled-bg: var(--control-disabled-bg),\n    --radio-disabled-opacity: var(--control-disabled-opacity),\n  ),\n  $radio-tokens\n);","language":""}],"demos":[{"key":"b20e3dd775f88a1bd86b","html":"<input type=\"radio\" id=\"radio\" class=\"radio\">","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"fde97e403f7c7975adeb","html":"<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <input class=\"radio\" name=\"radios\" type=\"radio\" id=\"radioLabel\">\n  <label for=\"radioLabel\">First example radio</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <input class=\"radio\" name=\"radios\" type=\"radio\" id=\"radioLabel2\">\n  <label for=\"radioLabel2\">Second example radio</label>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example d-flex flex-column gap-2"},"sprite":""},{"key":"c4820804a435cfdb33bd","html":"<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <input type=\"radio\" id=\"radioLabelDescription\" class=\"radio\">\n  <div class=\"form-field-content\">\n    <label for=\"radioLabelDescription\" class=\"fw-medium\">Example new radio</label